  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/8eiJj0sDE6O9T1Ivum9FQT56exkoXaubDCKCr6Iyd90v5FjMgTPb8VvG5w8TS44XM7XY6Vi4hlIvHkJx452f8ye0tOyQhTLXRQjf0phkstTRn7AuDH9TXeX8VGvGJmCz9el6G6Hm1oMtqwVvZA2b9W7XsmIJdMwgvSyLW1ZJuoxL8VUIpP5gFsbluo0GnJHx4wV80ENp\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/20/ee047228cda44c63602dbfa91608a254..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">本日もご帰宅ありがとうございました！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">久しぶりの本店でした</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">7階！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日はとってもまったりで</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いっぱいお話できて楽しかったです⊂(^・^)⊃</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">初挑戦のお団子も</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いつもと違う感じでてんしょんあがりました</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">お姉ちゃんに見たいからやってっていわれた！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/1FQwRHrwePP0x0wmr2lTjQnhdOoGMEvmsu9VpH4vZAneeRu7NeQHTLAW02v5G1BP1xdficlfZy3pVrWsDnIOKPSs9PdBypnQXmwOACLWp3Dz7jwea99vL0k0Aky8tzpoKSde4MnVvx9YcZQdGT9E5D62ko1qCX2OzkeJAA1qYrvmPsDHTRAuFrrpCRJ9yPhwYyuWd19d\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/20/4c8eb783a2d46a13524325bc76025ff0..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">装飾とったらちょっとみえるかな</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/SlviwqYxfcBb7jYVxZMvaa4s3qo2EAbBHRARitcWLCRfQo5ukeCWiTmdUrTjoSLFg0cv727F6FBlhHyfLf3Tbjb56WzDC3ZktMu3zdbpEFvm24rbmXgPp890nV3qznkuiubKFYmZLo5uLJy9iyKn3tigXBqHICinRIqB6ciTBlSprM8q7gIM6FckqnzENGJ4kGrloCNb\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/20/e1167f96aa84539fb6c087e013f50a86..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/Zw5L8SR7fTgJdLeYObXeVQK9A8zmrWSFKwQF5lETEYbhS1UVbd9qJMyMHzxpLdHMvko0N65bpyxCSKyn1m09rJJatkfKPbqldLEENRZUiy4h1TYeGpY1uVHaR9vwgK4JRrB5YsAemMhQrHbo0SyvJrJtkbtJfp20MfT8uM7blmXLnrfPo5lm4Uz0XBqRQro5ynS05Bow\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/20/3b67ae846aac3d0dbd0ac6752c936036..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">家帰って一応撮りました</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">色んな魔法挑戦したい！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">見たい髪型あったらおしえてね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">そして</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/nlp2Zh0gSIB9h1Vb4KLCBFLqrqqeNO8Z0tCM3ti6QVhV0g00BaB7dDovug0BOAVGOKHT9JxB3PYBZfjAEDCCjEP7SukS8YuXFItaImedh3V4SKU66qNGrY7Q8pGVye5Kw5NpSZyk9KG25HGaAeLvn60VOXxgPBNMLh7Yub2xWEjszs7wYg3UfuzAYXnB2UxNJiT1NbwV\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/20/d404d0f8c7aa20edaecde46af8572b60..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/AWY24vzHNtzIKXlMthl93a6GfwRUi9C50NcWSPzFwoI6Oz2SbbLfcH0nYhPhcwmYZcypjK6p6MIIi7LGD53O5zOCzFUPpNZNw9kheSY4xDCrz6in6TjQMdsTk8c4xZ7WeJKgeraGsz94gBkZZe0zVEOV5IbN3fKOhc6sfB5JBzUt2KIEDTflwxRbhXIn0a5Zov2OB7iK\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/20/3ca670e000174dd0097277981c6e039a..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">みてーあむさんとお給仕かぶった！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">とにかくずーっとだる絡みしてた</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとにだいすき！＞ω＜ 愛、です！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/5HH1JthmqFFQ0r5tinWPjPahLIEhNrBBBQ7ClEXX1WC1jEKOaYd9sSsnzyqXEz6qTGPBBEppKvVis5lS7KE0zrH2Wve2KA7aa9QJ5f17t76o7inz8Ht0opeOrCBm7bdQIr0NkGNKyiburWkv3OiwlhOrFO8oGdn0QnvcbuCDWJzqioLkJ3BlZIynUy6Oyhq9eyscShW5\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/20/33912c714b767197317d0c6c7756c1a0..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ひつじちゃんとはロッカーで会えたよう！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">好き！好き！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いまだにお給仕かぶれたことない！😿えん</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ひつじちゃんは明日初のコスデーみたいで</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私がわくわくしてるよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">初めましての方、仲良しさんにいっぱい会えて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日もすごく楽しかった！7周あっというま！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">コレチェキのお絵描きも褒めてくれてありがとう😿</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ついったーみてきてくれたひともありがとう😿</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">めちゃくちゃ笑ったし、新しい出会いにも</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">感謝です、ぐるぐるたのしー😿うう</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ばかさむいのに半袖できた海外のご主人様</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今どうしてるんだろうwww</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">一応、コールド！コールド！って</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">言っといたけど、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">1月には仮店お給仕になって定位置に留まるので</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">いまのうちにたくさんお給仕楽しみます</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">寒いのでみんな体調はきをつけてくださ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おやすみー</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
